+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, and this applies going forward. Development and testing that needs a TLS endpoint uses self-signed certificates rather than turning verification off. HTTPS is used everywhere with no plaintext exception, so internal hosts are covered by the same rule.
